      "source": [
        "# 🔬 AI Research Assistant — LLM + RAG + Agentic Reasoning\n",
        "\n",
        "> **Stack:** LLaMA 3 (via Groq) · HuggingFace Embeddings · FAISS Vector Store · LangChain Agents\n",
        "\n",
        "---\n",
        "\n",
        "## Project Overview\n",
        "\n",
        "This notebook implements a **fully autonomous AI Research Assistant** that combines three cutting-edge AI paradigms:\n",
        "\n",
        "| Paradigm | Role in this project |\n",
        "|---|---|\n",
        "| **Large Language Model (LLM)** | Reasoning, summarization, and answer generation (LLaMA 3 via Groq) |\n",
        "| **Retrieval-Augmented Generation (RAG)** | Grounds LLM answers in real documents via semantic vector search |\n",
        "| **AI Agent** | Decides *which tool to use* based on the query — no hardcoded logic |\n",
        "\n",
        "---\n",
        "\n",
        "## 🧠 Architecture\n",
        "\n",
        "```\n",
        "User Query\n",
        "    │\n",
        "    ▼\n",
        "┌─────────────────────────────────┐\n",
        "│         AI Agent (LLaMA 3)      │\n",
        "│   Decides which tool to invoke  │\n",
        "└────────────┬────────────────────┘\n",
        "             │\n",
        "    ┌────────┴──────────┐\n",
        "    │                   │\n",
        "    ▼                   ▼\n",
        "┌─────────┐      ┌──────────────┐\n",
        "│   RAG   │      │  Summarizer  │\n",
        "│  Tool   │      │    Tool      │\n",
        "│(FAISS + │      │(LLM direct)  │\n",
        "│HF Embed)│      └──────────────┘\n",
        "└────┬────┘\n",
        "     │\n",
        "     ▼\n",
        "Retrieved Chunks → LLM → Final Answer\n",
        "```\n",
        "\n",
        "---\n",
        "\n",
        "## ⚙️ Key Components\n",
        "\n",
        "### 1. Document Ingestion & Chunking\n",
        "Raw text documents are split into overlapping chunks to preserve context across boundaries. This is a critical step — poor chunking leads to poor retrieval.\n",
        "\n",
        "### 2. HuggingFace Embeddings\n",
        "We use `sentence-transformers/all-MiniLM-L6-v2` to convert text chunks into dense vector representations. These embeddings capture *semantic meaning*, not just keyword overlap.\n",
        "\n",
        "### 3. FAISS Vector Store\n",
        "Facebook AI Similarity Search (FAISS) stores the embeddings and enables fast approximate nearest-neighbour (ANN) retrieval. At query time, the top-k most semantically similar chunks are fetched.\n",
        "\n",
        "### 4. LLaMA 3 via Groq\n",
        "Groq's LPU inference engine delivers extremely low-latency LLaMA 3 completions. The LLM is used both as the agent's reasoning engine and as the answer generator.\n",
        "\n",
        "### 5. Agentic Loop\n",
        "A ReAct-style agent (Reason → Act → Observe) decides at each step which tool to invoke. The agent has access to:\n",
        "- **`rag_search`** — semantic search over ingested documents\n",
        "- **`summarize_topic`** — direct LLM summarization for general knowledge\n",
        "- **`count_documents`** — meta-tool to inspect the knowledge base\n",
        "\n",
        "---\n",
        "\n",
        "## 🗂️ Project Structure\n",
        "\n",
        "```\n",
        "research_assistant_agent.ipynb\n",
        "├── Section 0 — Setup & Installations\n",
        "├── Section 1 — Configuration\n",
        "├── Section 2 — Document Ingestion & RAG Pipeline\n",
        "├── Section 3 — Groq LLM Setup\n",
        "├── Section 4 — Agent Tools\n",
        "├── Section 5 — Agent Construction\n",
        "├── Section 6 — Interactive Demo\n",
        "└── Section 7 — Evaluation & Insights\n",
        "```\n",
        "\n",
        "---\n",
        "\n",
        "## 📦 Requirements\n",
        "\n",
        "- Python 3.10+\n",
        "- Groq API Key → [console.groq.com](https://console.groq.com)\n",
        "- All other dependencies installed in Section 0"
      ]
