        "    \"\"\"\n",
        "    Generate a structured summary of a topic using the LLM directly.\n",
        "\n",
        "    Use this tool when the question is broad, conceptual, or unlikely\n",
        "    to be answered by specific documents in the knowledge base.\n",
        "\n",
        "    Parameters\n",
        "    ----------\n",
        "    topic : str\n",
        "        The research topic or concept to summarise.\n",
        "\n",
        "    Returns\n",
